const pageList=[['設計研究','style','00','風格與設計依據'],['業務端','home','01','預約首頁'],['','login','02','登入頁面'],['','client','03','客戶資料'],['','service','04','選擇預約項目'],['','datetime','05','日期與時段'],['','confirm','06','確認預約'],['','success','07','預約完成'],['','list','08','我的預約'],['','detail','09','預約詳情'],['管理後台','admin','10','預約總覽'],['','schedule','11','醫師班表'],['','options','12','項目與營業設定'],['','users','13','帳號與權限']];
let current='home',isMobile=false,month=10,year=2026;const draft={rep:'業務 A',name:'示範客戶',phone:'0900000000',service:'療程諮詢',date:'2026-11-17',time:'14:00',note:''};let records=[{id:'PI-20261117-001',name:'示範客戶 A',phone:'0900000000',service:'療程諮詢',date:'2026-11-17',time:'13:00',rep:'業務 A',status:'已預約'},{id:'PI-20261117-002',name:'示範客戶 B',phone:'0900000000',service:'例行保養與療程',date:'2026-11-17',time:'16:00',rep:'業務 B',status:'已預約'},{id:'PI-20261113-003',name:'示範客戶 C',phone:'0900000000',service:'自費',date:'2026-11-13',time:'10:00',rep:'業務 A',status:'已完成'}];let selected=records[0],submitted=null,query='',statusFilter='全部狀態';let serviceItems=['健保','自費','療程諮詢','例行保養與療程','點滴／針劑','疫苗','其他'];const esc=s=>String(s??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));
const btn=(text,action,secondary=false)=>`<button class="btn ${secondary?'secondary':''}" onclick="${action}">${text}</button>`;const title=(en,cn,desc='')=>`<div class="eyebrow">${en}</div><h1>${cn}</h1>${desc?`<p class="muted">${desc}</p>`:''}`;const field=(label,key,value,type='text')=>`<label class="field">${label}<input type="${type}" value="${esc(value)}" onchange="draft.${key}=this.value" autocomplete="off"></label>`;const pill=s=>`<span class="badge ${s==='已完成'?'gray':s==='已取消'?'sand':''}">${s}</span>`;
function nav(){document.getElementById('pages').innerHTML=pageList.map(([group,id,no,name])=>(group?`<h5>${group}</h5>`:'')+`<button class="${current===id?'active':''}" onclick="go('${id}')"><em>${no}</em>${name}</button>`).join('');document.getElementById('pagename').textContent=pageList.find(p=>p[1]===current)[3]}
function device(m){isMobile=m;document.body.classList.toggle('mobile',m);document.getElementById('mobile').classList.toggle('active',m);document.getElementById('desktop').classList.toggle('active',!m)}
function go(id){current=id;location.hash=id;document.body.classList.remove('menu-open');render();window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'instant'})}
function toast(msg){const t=document.getElementById('toast');t.textContent=msg;t.classList.add('show');setTimeout(()=>t.classList.remove('show'),2800)}
function header(admin=false){return `<header class="top"><img class="brand" src="assets/logo.svg" alt="PURE IN 樸原健康診所"><span class="word">${admin?'MANAGEMENT':'APPOINTMENT'}</span><div class="topnav"><button class="textbtn ${current==='home'?'selected':''}" onclick="go('home')">預約首頁</button><button class="textbtn ${current==='list'?'selected':''}" onclick="go('list')">我的預約</button><div class="avatar">${admin?'管':'A'}</div></div></header>${admin?`<div class="adminnav">${[['admin','預約總覽'],['schedule','醫師班表'],['options','項目與營業'],['users','帳號與權限']].map(([id,n])=>`<button class="${current===id?'selected':''}" onclick="go('${id}')">${n}</button>`).join('')}</div>`:''}`}
const footer=()=>`<footer class="foot"><span>PURE IN · 以從容，開始每一次服務。</span><span>視覺原型 / 示範資料 / 尚未連接正式系統</span></footer>`;
function steps(n){return `<div class="steps">${['客戶資料','預約項目','日期時段','確認預約'].map((v,i)=>`${i?'<i></i>':''}<div class="${i<=n?'on':''}"><b>${i<n?'✓':i+1}</b>${v}</div>`).join('')}</div>`}
function summary(){return `<aside class="summary"><div class="eyebrow">Your appointment</div><div class="serif">預約摘要</div><div class="sumline"><small>負責業務</small>${esc(draft.rep)}</div><div class="sumline"><small>客戶</small>${esc(draft.name)||'尚未填寫'}</div><div class="sumline"><small>預約項目</small>${esc(draft.service)}</div><div class="sumline"><small>預約時間</small>${draft.date}<br>${draft.time} – ${endtime(draft.time)}</div><div class="note">每次服務保留 60 分鐘，<br>讓每一次到訪都被好好安排。</div></aside>`}
function formpage(n,body){return `${header()}<main class="content">${steps(n)}<div class="formgrid"><div>${body}</div>${summary()}</div></main>${footer()}`}
const endtime=t=>(Number(t.split(':')[0])+1)+':00';
function home(){return `${header()}<section class="hero"><div><div class="eyebrow">A thoughtful beginning</div><h1>為每一次到訪，<br>留一段專屬時光。</h1><div class="english">Care begins with a moment.</div><p>從一個簡單的預約開始，<br>讓專業照護，自然融入生活。</p>${btn('建立新預約　↗',"go('client')")}<p class="muted">週一至週六 10:00–19:00 · 每次預約 60 分鐘</p></div><div class="arch"><img src="assets/clinic.png" alt="樸原診所暖色調接待空間"><small>PURE IN / A SPACE FOR WELLBEING</small></div></section><div class="quickrow"><button onclick="go('list')"><b>${records.filter(r=>r.rep==='業務 A'&&r.status==='已預約').length.toString().padStart(2,'0')}</b><span>即將到來的預約<small>UPCOMING APPOINTMENTS</small></span></button><button onclick="go('datetime')"><b>↗</b><span>查看可預約時段<small>FIND YOUR MOMENT</small></span></button><button onclick="go('admin')"><b>☷</b><span>進入管理後台<small>MANAGEMENT PREVIEW</small></span></button></div>${footer()}`}
function login(){return `<div class="login"><div class="loginvisual"><div class="eyebrow">Pure in · Pure care</div><div class="arch"><img src="assets/clinic.png" alt="診所空間"></div><h2>細緻的服務，<br>從每個小地方開始。</h2><p class="muted">PURE IN APPOINTMENT SYSTEM</p></div><div class="loginform"><img class="brand" src="assets/logo.svg" alt="PURE IN"><div class="eyebrow">Welcome back</div><h1>歡迎回來</h1><p class="muted">登入帳號，開始今天的預約服務。</p><label class="field">使用者帳號<input placeholder="請輸入帳號" autocomplete="off"></label><label class="field">密碼<input type="password" placeholder="請輸入密碼" autocomplete="off"></label>${btn('預覽業務登入　→',"go('home')")}<button class="textbtn" onclick="go('admin')" style="margin-top:14px">預覽管理者登入 →</button><p class="muted" style="font-size:10px">此為登入樣式展示，不驗證或儲存密碼。<br>正式系統將依帳號角色顯示可用功能。</p></div></div>`}
function client(){return formpage(0,`<div class="formhead">${title('01 / Client information','先認識這次的來訪者','只需要幾項基本資料，就能開始安排。')}</div><label class="field">負責業務 <span style="color:var(--brown)">*</span><select onchange="draft.rep=this.value"><option ${draft.rep==='業務 A'?'selected':''}>業務 A</option><option ${draft.rep==='業務 B'?'selected':''}>業務 B</option></select></label><div class="two">${field('客戶姓名 *','name',draft.name)}${field('聯絡電話 *','phone',draft.phone,'tel')}</div><label class="field">備註 <span class="muted">（選填）</span><textarea rows="3" placeholder="如有需事先協助的事項，請在此補充" onchange="draft.note=this.value">${esc(draft.note)}</textarea></label><p class="muted" style="font-size:10px">目前為示範資料，請勿輸入真實個資。</p><div id="formerror" class="error" role="alert"></div><div class="actions">${btn('返回首頁',"go('home')",true)}${btn('下一步　→','nextClient()')}</div>`)}
function nextClient(){if(!draft.name.trim()||!/^0\d{8,9}$/.test(draft.phone)){document.getElementById('formerror').textContent='請填寫姓名與有效的台灣聯絡電話（09 開頭手機或含區碼市話）。';return}go('service')}
function service(){const descriptions=['一般門診照護','自費醫療服務','了解適合的服務安排','持續照護與定期回訪','安排點滴或針劑服務','疫苗接種預約','其他預約需求'];return formpage(1,`<div class="formhead">${title('02 / Purpose of visit','這次，想安排什麼服務？','選擇一項預約類別，接著安排適合的時間。')}</div><div class="choices">${serviceItems.map((s,i)=>`<button class="choice ${draft.service===s?'chosen':''}" onclick="draft.service=serviceItems[${i}];render()"><span class="icon">${['＋','◇','◎','↻','✧','⊕','…'][i]}</span><strong>${s}</strong><small>${descriptions[i]||'預約服務'}</small></button>`).join('')}</div><div class="note">醫師需求與各項目可約條件，將由後台設定；目前僅展示介面與營業時段。</div><div class="actions">${btn('← 上一步',"go('client')",true)}${btn('選擇日期　→',"go('datetime')")}</div>`)}
function datepage(){let first=new Date(year,month,1).getDay(),count=new Date(year,month+1,0).getDate();return formpage(2,`<div class="formhead">${title('03 / Date & time','選一個，剛剛好的時間。','每次預約 60 分鐘，同一時段僅開放一筆預約。')}</div><div class="calendarhead"><button aria-label="上一個月" onclick="changeMonth(-1)">‹</button><b>${year} / ${String(month+1).padStart(2,'0')}</b><button aria-label="下一個月" onclick="changeMonth(1)">›</button></div><div class="week">${['日','一','二','三','四','五','六'].map(d=>`<div>${d}</div>`).join('')}</div><div class="calendar">${'<span></span>'.repeat(first)}${Array.from({length:count},(_,i)=>{let d=i+1,ds=`${year}-${String(month+1).padStart(2,'0')}-${String(d).padStart(2,'0')}`,off=new Date(year,month,d).getDay()===0||ds<'2026-11-13';return `<button ${off?'disabled':''} class="${draft.date===ds?'active':''}" aria-label="${ds}" onclick="draft.date='${ds}';draft.time='';render()">${d}</button>`}).join('')}</div><div class="note">${draft.date}　·　${doctorFor(draft.date)}<br>週日休診；醫師時段以班表為準。</div><div class="slots">${Array.from({length:9},(_,i)=>{let t=(i+10)+':00',busy=records.some(r=>r.date===draft.date&&r.time===t&&r.status!=='已取消');return `<button class="slot ${draft.time===t?'active':''}" ${busy?'disabled':''} onclick="draft.time='${t}';render()">${t}<small>${busy?'已額滿':'可預約'}</small></button>`}).join('')}</div><div class="actions">${btn('← 上一步',"go('service')",true)}<button class="btn" ${!draft.time?'disabled':''} onclick="go('confirm')">確認資料　→</button></div>`)}
function changeMonth(n){month+=n;if(month>11){month=0;year++}if(month<0){month=11;year--}render()}
function doctorFor(d){const day=new Date(d+'T12:00:00').getDay();return day===2?'廖醫師 13:00–19:00':day===4?'嚴醫師 13:00–19:00':day===5?'醫師待設定 10:00–17:00':'當日無醫師門診班表'}
function review(d){return `<dl class="reviewlist">${[['負責業務',d.rep],['客戶姓名',d.name],['聯絡電話',d.phone],['預約項目',d.service],['日期與時段',`${d.date}　${d.time}–${endtime(d.time)}`],['備註',d.note||'無']].map(([k,v])=>`<div><dt>${k}</dt><dd>${esc(v)}</dd></div>`).join('')}</dl>`}
function confirmPage(){return formpage(3,`<div class="formhead">${title('04 / Review appointment','再確認一次，就準備好了。','請核對客戶資料及預約時間。')}</div>${review(draft)}<label class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="agree" onchange="document.getElementById('submit').disabled=!this.checked">我已確認以上預約資料正確</label><div id="formerror" class="error" role="alert"></div><div class="actions">${btn('← 修改時間',"go('datetime')",true)}<button id="submit" class="btn" disabled onclick="submitBooking()">完成示範預約　↗</button></div>`)}
function submitBooking(){if(records.some(r=>r.date===draft.date&&r.time===draft.time&&r.status!=='已取消')){document.getElementById('formerror').textContent='此時段已被預約，請返回重新選擇。';return}submitted={...draft,id:'DEMO-'+String(records.length+1).padStart(3,'0'),status:'已預約'};records.unshift(submitted);selected=submitted;go('success')}
function success(){const d=submitted||draft;return `${header()}<main class="content"><div class="success"><div class="seal">✓</div>${title('A moment reserved','專屬時光，已為你保留。','預約完成樣式示範；尚未向診所送出真實預約。')}<div class="ticket"><div class="eyebrow">${submitted?submitted.id:'DEMO PREVIEW'}</div><div class="bigdate">${d.date.replaceAll('-',' / ')}</div><h3 style="margin-top:12px">${d.time} — ${endtime(d.time)}</h3><div class="sumline">${esc(d.name)}　·　${esc(d.service)}<br><small>負責業務 ${esc(d.rep)}</small></div></div>${btn('查看我的預約',"go('list')")}${btn('再建立一筆',"go('client')",true)}</div></main>${footer()}`}
function table(rows,admin=false){return `<div class="tablewrap"><table><thead><tr><th>日期 / 時段</th><th>客戶</th><th>預約項目</th>${admin?'<th>負責業務</th>':''}<th>狀態</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody>${rows.length?rows.map(r=>`<tr><td>${r.date}<small>${r.time}–${endtime(r.time)}</small></td><td>${esc(r.name)}<small>示範資料</small></td><td>${esc(r.service)}</td>${admin?`<td>${esc(r.rep)}</td>`:''}<td>${pill(r.status)}</td><td><button onclick="openDetail('${r.id}')">查看 ↗</button></td></tr>`).join(''):`<tr><td colspan="6" class="empty">沒有符合條件的預約。請調整搜尋文字或狀態。</td></tr>`}</tbody></table></div>`}
function openDetail(id){selected=records.find(r=>r.id===id);go('detail')}
function list(admin=false){let rows=records.filter(r=>(admin||r.rep==='業務 A')&&(r.name.includes(query)||r.service.includes(query)||r.id.includes(query))&&(statusFilter==='全部狀態'||r.status===statusFilter));return `${header(admin)}<main class="content"><div class="headrow"><div>${title(admin?'Daily overview':'My appointments',admin?'每一天，都安排得從容。':'我的預約',admin?'2026 年 11 月 · 團隊預約工作台':'隨時掌握每一次到訪的安排。')}</div>${btn('＋ 新增預約',"go('client')")}</div>${admin?`<div class="metrics"><div class="metric"><span>全部預約<small>ALL APPOINTMENTS</small></span><b>${records.length.toString().padStart(2,'0')}</b></div><div class="metric"><span>已預約<small>RESERVED</small></span><b>${records.filter(r=>r.status==='已預約').length.toString().padStart(2,'0')}</b></div><div class="metric"><span>已完成<small>COMPLETED</small></span><b>${records.filter(r=>r.status==='已完成').length.toString().padStart(2,'0')}</b></div></div>`:''}<div class="toolbar"><input aria-label="搜尋預約" placeholder="搜尋客戶姓名、項目或預約編號" value="${esc(query)}" oninput="query=this.value;filterRows(${admin})"><select aria-label="預約狀態" onchange="statusFilter=this.value;render()">${['全部狀態','已預約','已完成','已取消'].map(s=>`<option ${s===statusFilter?'selected':''}>${s}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div id="results">${table(rows,admin)}</div><p class="muted" style="font-size:10px">${admin?'顯示所有業務的示範預約':'目前預覽業務 A 的預約'} · 可點選「查看」檢視詳情</p></main>${footer()}`}
function filterRows(admin){document.getElementById('results').innerHTML=table(records.filter(r=>(admin||r.rep==='業務 A')&&(r.name.includes(query)||r.service.includes(query)||r.id.includes(query))&&(statusFilter==='全部狀態'||r.status===statusFilter)),admin)}
function detail(){return `${header()}<main class="content"><button class="textbtn" onclick="go('list')">← 返回預約清單</button><div class="headrow" style="margin-top:25px"><div>${title('Appointment details','每個細節，都妥善安排。')}</div>${pill(selected.status)}</div><div class="detailgrid"><div><div class="eyebrow">${selected.id}</div>${review(selected)}<div class="actions">${btn('修改示範預約','editRecord()',true)}${selected.status==='已取消'?'':btn('取消示範預約',"cancelRecord()",true)}</div><div id="cancelbox"></div></div><aside class="summary" style="display:block"><h3>預約動態</h3><div class="timeline"><p>預約資料已建立<small>業務端 · 示範紀錄</small></p><p>${selected.status}<small>目前預約狀態</small></p></div><p class="muted">此處可檢視預約的建立、修改與取消紀錄。</p></aside></div></main>${footer()}`}
function editRecord(){Object.assign(draft,selected);go('client');toast('示範修改流程：完成後將新增一筆展示紀錄。')}
function cancelRecord(){document.getElementById('cancelbox').innerHTML=`<div class="note">確定取消這筆示範預約？<div style="margin-top:12px">${btn('確認取消',"selected.status='已取消';render();toast('示範預約已取消')")}${btn('保留預約',"render()",true)}</div></div>`}
function schedule(){return `${header(true)}<main class="content"><div class="headrow"><div>${title('Doctor schedules','把專業，安排在對的時間。','每週固定班表 · 可依營運需要調整')}</div></div><div class="schedule">${[['TUE','週二','廖醫師','13:00','19:00'],['THU','週四','嚴醫師','13:00','19:00'],['FRI','週五','醫師待設定','10:00','17:00']].map(([en,day,name,start,end],i)=>`<div class="doctor"><div class="day">${en}</div><div class="eyebrow">${day}</div><h3>${name}</h3><p>${start} — ${end}</p><span class="badge ${i===2?'sand':''}">${i===2?'待補醫師':'每週固定'}</span><button class="textbtn" onclick="scheduleEdit(${i})">編輯班表　↗</button></div>`).join('')}</div><div id="scheduleedit"></div><div class="panel"><h3>臨時休診 / 封鎖時段</h3><p class="muted">針對單日或特定時段，暫停開放預約。</p><div class="two"><label class="field">封鎖日期<input type="date" value="2026-11-20"></label><label class="field">時段<select><option>全天</option><option>10:00–11:00</option><option>13:00–14:00</option></select></label></div>${btn('預覽封鎖狀態',"toast('封鎖樣式已預覽；正式班表尚未異動。')",true)}</div></main>${footer()}`}
function scheduleEdit(i){document.getElementById('scheduleedit').innerHTML=`<div class="panel" style="margin-bottom:25px"><h3>編輯${['週二','週四','週五'][i]}班表</h3><label class="field">醫師姓名<input value="${['廖醫師','嚴醫師','待設定'][i]}"></label><div class="two"><label class="field">開始時間<input type="time" value="${i===2?'10:00':'13:00'}"></label><label class="field">結束時間<input type="time" value="${i===2?'17:00':'19:00'}"></label></div>${btn('完成樣式預覽',"document.getElementById('scheduleedit').innerHTML='';toast('已完成編輯樣式預覽，尚未儲存正式班表。')")}</div>`}
function options(){return `${header(true)}<main class="content">${title('Service & availability','讓每個選項，都清楚有序。','管理預約項目與營業時間。')}<div class="detailgrid" style="margin-top:30px"><section><h3>預約項目</h3>${serviceItems.map((s,i)=>`<div class="settingsrow"><div><b>${s}</b><small>於前台選擇預約項目時顯示</small></div><button class="toggle" role="switch" aria-label="${s}" aria-checked="true" onclick="this.classList.toggle('off');this.setAttribute('aria-checked',!this.classList.contains('off'));toast('已切換顯示樣式，未異動正式設定。')"></button></div>`).join('')}</section><section><div class="panel"><h3>營業時間</h3><label class="field">營業日<select><option>週一至週六</option></select></label><div class="two"><label class="field">開始<input type="time" value="10:00"></label><label class="field">結束<input type="time" value="19:00"></label></div><div class="sumline"><small>每筆預約</small>60 分鐘</div><div class="sumline"><small>同時段容量</small>全院 1 筆</div><div class="sumline"><small>固定休診</small>星期日</div>${btn('儲存樣式預覽',"toast('設定畫面已確認；正式設定尚未儲存。')")}</div><div class="note">此提案依你指定：週六開放至 19:00。官網頁尾為週六至 17:00，正式上線前需統一對外資訊。</div></section></div></main>${footer()}`}
function users(){return `${header(true)}<main class="content"><div class="headrow"><div>${title('People & permissions','讓對的人，做好每一件事。','管理業務與管理者帳號，以及功能存取權限。')}</div>${btn('＋ 新增帳號',"showUser()")}</div><div class="tablewrap"><table><thead><tr><th>使用者</th><th>帳號</th><th>角色</th><th>狀態</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody>${[['管理者','admin.demo','管理者'],['業務 A','sales.a.demo','業務'],['業務 B','sales.b.demo','業務']].map(([name,acc,role])=>`<tr><td>${name}</td><td>${acc}</td><td>${role}</td><td>${pill('啟用中')}</td><td><button onclick="showUser('${name}','${acc}','${role}')">編輯 ↗</button></td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div><div id="useredit"></div><div class="note">業務：建立與管理自己的預約。<br>管理者：管理全部預約、醫師班表、預約項目與使用者帳號。<br>權限為設計提案，正式上線時需由伺服器驗證。</div></main>${footer()}`}
function showUser(name='',acc='',role='業務'){document.getElementById('useredit').innerHTML=`<div class="panel" style="margin-top:25px"><h3>${name?'編輯':'新增'}帳號</h3><div class="two"><label class="field">姓名<input value="${name}" placeholder="請輸入姓名"></label><label class="field">帳號<input value="${acc}" placeholder="請輸入帳號"></label></div><div class="two"><label class="field">角色<select><option ${role==='業務'?'selected':''}>業務</option><option ${role==='管理者'?'selected':''}>管理者</option></select></label><label class="field">初始密碼<input type="password" placeholder="樣式展示，請勿輸入真實密碼"></label></div>${btn('完成樣式預覽',"document.getElementById('useredit').innerHTML='';toast('已完成帳號樣式預覽，未建立實際帳號。')")}</div>`}
function stylepage(){return `${header()}<main class="content">${title('Design direction / 01','將樸原的從容，延伸到每一次預約。','依 PURE IN 官網實際樣式表與圖像，轉譯為更適合日常操作的預約介面。')}<div class="swatches">${[['#FFFCF9','暖米白','頁面底色'],['#895638','陶土棕','主要操作'],['#6E5A50','深灰棕','標題文字'],['#897870','柔灰棕','輔助文字'],['#F1EEE7','淺燕麥','資訊分區']].map(([color,n,use])=>`<div class="swatch"><div style="background:${color}"></div><b>${n} ${color}</b><small>${use}</small></div>`).join('')}</div><div class="research"><div><div class="eyebrow">From brand to experience</div><h2>溫暖、純粹、有呼吸感。</h2><p>原站以暖白與棕色建立視覺基調，搭配拱形照片、細線與寬鬆字距。中文使用 Noto Sans TC / Noto Serif TC，英文搭配 Playfair Display。</p><p>預約系統延續原站的材質感與字體層次，以少量邊框和低對比底色區分資訊；主要操作使用深棕色，讓下一步清楚可見。</p><h3 style="margin-top:28px">每一頁，只處理一個決定。</h3><p>前台拆為四步，保留上一頁資料；桌面附預約摘要，手機則讓表單優先。後台保留相同視覺語言，縮小裝飾面積，增加班表與清單的閱讀效率。</p></div><div><img src="assets/clinic.png" alt="官網原始空間照片，僅供本提案設計對照"><p class="muted">原站空間照片 · 暖灰石材、木色、柔和自然光。</p></div></div><div class="panel" style="margin-top:25px"><h3>本次完整頁面範圍</h3><p class="muted">首頁與登入 / 客戶資料 / 預約項目 / 日期與時段 / 確認 / 完成 / 我的預約 / 詳情 / 管理總覽 / 醫師班表 / 項目與營業 / 帳號與權限</p><p class="muted">點左側頁面選單逐一檢視；右上角可切換手機尺寸。首頁開始可走完整示範流程，前台預約變更僅保留在目前頁面的記憶體，重新整理即重置。</p></div><div class="source">研究來源：<a href="https://www.purein.com.tw" target="_blank" rel="noopener">purein.com.tw</a>（2026-11-13）。依據 Base.css、Base_Visitor.css、DefaultVisitor.css 與原站公開圖片。色碼與字體為原站設定；表單、進度列、清單及後台為本次延伸設計。<br>原站 Logo 與空間照片僅用於這份設計提案的品牌對照。研究以原始 HTML、CSS 與圖像為依據；原站動態效果未完成瀏覽器實測。<br>需確認差異：官網週六營業至 17:00；本系統依先前要求設為 19:00。醫師需求與項目對應規則尚待設定，原型不代替正式預約檢核。</div></main>${footer()}`}
function render(){nav();document.getElementById('app').innerHTML=({home,login,client,service,datetime:datepage,confirm:confirmPage,success,list:()=>list(false),detail,admin:()=>list(true),schedule,options,users,style:stylepage}[current]||home)()}
window.addEventListener('hashchange',()=>{let id=location.hash.slice(1);if(pageList.some(p=>p[1]===id)&&id!==current){current=id;render()}});if(pageList.some(p=>p[1]===location.hash.slice(1)))current=location.hash.slice(1);render();
